<description><![CDATA[<p>An old lorewalker opens his ledger to a new name: Laotou, a Pandaren monk who walks into Dornogal and straight into a mystery of missing gold.</p>
]]></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Sit, sit. The tea is still warm. In the first episode of My Azeroth Life, the Lorewalker reads the first three pages of Laotou’s story, the Pandaren monk of Stormrage (say it “Lau-Toe”).</p>
<p>Chapters:</p>
<ol>
<li>Prologue</li>
<li>A Stranger in Dornogal</li>
<li>Parhelion Plaza</li>
<li>The Lightbloom and the Knight-Errant</li>
<li>Epilogue</li>
</ol>
<p>Read the original posts:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://myazerothlife.com/2026/10/laotou-a-stranger-in-dornogal/">A Stranger in Dornogal</a></li>
<li><a href="https://myazerothlife.com/2026/10/laotou-parhelion-plaza/">Parhelion Plaza</a></li>
<li><a href="https://myazerothlife.com/2026/10/laotou-lightbloom/">The Lightbloom</a></li>
</ul>
<p>The narrator’s voice, music and sound were made with ElevenLabs.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
